{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1554842-tamers-of-light","id":1554842,"title":"Tamers of Light","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2025-10-30T07:03:23-07:00","id":1554842,"title":"Tamers of Light","content":"Hey everyone,<br /> <br /> I was just wondering if anyone bad ever done a write up on the Tamers of Light, very briefly mentioned in the first edition book Legacies: The Ancient?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28961-sabelforge","name":"Sabelforge","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar28961_1.webp","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2025"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-10-30T07:51:36-07:00","id":1554847,"title":"","content":"Not as far as I know, but based on Tamer philosophy, they would believe metaphysical and material light are one and the same. So the main Arcanum would be Forces, to manipulate the physical one.<br /> <br /> The optional Arcanum would probably be Prime, with a heavy focus on light as an agent of truth and revelation. So spells like <i>Shared Sight</i>, the Reach version of <i>Pierce Deception,</i> an indefinite version of <i>Stealing Fire</i> to show the supernatural to the willing and even a powerful version of <i>Words of Truth</i> (instant, sensory range, advanced duration and compelling) are all Attainments I could see them having.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 10-30-2025, 11:22 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-10-30T10:50:48-07:00","id":1554855,"title":"","content":"Here are some rough ideas for possible Attainments, hope they prove helpful:<br /> <br /> <b>Forces 1</b><br /> <i>Nightvision</i> with Reach assigned to advanced duration.<br /> <br /> <b>Explanation: </b>Find light even in the darkest places.<br /> <br /> <b>Prime 1</b><br /> <i>Shared Sight</i> with Reach assigned to advanced duration and it incorporates every Arcanum the mage knows. A point of mana in total is used to pay for everything, per Legacy rules.<br /> <br /> <b>Explanation: </b>Allows others to see more aspects of the supernatural than ever before.<br /> <br /> <b>Forces 2</b><br /> <i>Influence Light </i>withReach assigned to instant use and advanced duration.<br /> <br /> <b>Explanation: </b>Guide the direction and flow of light.<br /> <br /> <b>Prime 2</b><br /> <i>Supernal Vision</i> with Reach assigned to advanced duration and revealing non-Supernal phenomena. <br /> <br /> <b>Explanation: </b>Allows the supernatural to be more easily detected. You should be able to use Attainments pseudo-dice to extend duration to a day when you first unlock it, and for a week when you reach Prime 4.<br /> <br /> <b>Forces 3</b><br /> <i>Invisibility</i> with Reach assigned to instant use and advanced duration.<br /> <br /> <b>Explanation:</b> Hide the light of any subjects.<br /> <br /> <b>Prime 3</b><br /> <i>Pierce Deception</i> with Reach assigned to instant use, advanced duration and giving a symbolic representation of the truth.<br /> <br /> <b>Explanation: </b>Expose falsehoods and bring them into the light. Given instant use so the mage can always use it on others to help point out the truth.<br /> <br /> <b>Forces 4</b><br /> <i>Zoom In </i>with Reach assigned to advanced duration, seeing microscopic particles and not being affected by atmospheric conditions.<br /> <br /> <b>Explanation: </b>See the world with more details and quality than ever before.<br /> <br /> <b>Prime 4</b><br /> <i>Stealing Fire</i> with Reach assigned to indefinite duration and a point of mana paying for indefinite duration.<br /> <br /> <b>Explanation: </b>Allows Sleepers to start perceiving the supernatural, and when paired with the other Attainments, they can start understanding it.<br /> <br /> <b>Forces 5</b><br /> <i>Control Light </i>with Reach assigned to instant use, advanced scale, advanced duration and being able to create a blackout effect.<br /> <br /> <b>Explanation: </b>Creates mirages, illusions, blackouts and more.<br /> <br /> <b>Prime 5</b><br /> <i>Words of Truth</i> with Reach assigned to instant use, sensory range, advanced duration and compelling action.<br /> <br /> <b>Explanation: </b>Illuminate the truth and make it impossible to ignore.","signature":"